<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Lucent started as neutral.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Lucent started as neutral.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber initiated Lucent Technologies Inc with a neutral rating, a market source said.</p>
<p>-- shares fell 1/4 to 39-1/2 in midmorning exchange trading.</p>
